    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$leaveshake",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor! Everyone! Great, I finally found you guys!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*, Doctor, you had me worried.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Blaze, why are you wearing your swimsuit... and carrying some kid on your back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I ran into this little girl on my way over here. She started hitting me for some reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I kicked her ass, of course, and beat down all her friends too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gotta hand it to her, she's not bad in a fight, didn't go down easy. So I brought her along. I figured you could help me ask why she wanted to fight me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Kemar. She probably just thought you looked strong. She just loves fighting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. That means something, coming from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't love fighting. I'm just a hands-on problem solver.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_415_flint_1#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Where... am I...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_415_flint_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Morning, Kemar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_415_flint_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial?! What are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_415_flint_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You bumped into my friend, fought her, and lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_415_flint_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, welcome back, kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_415_flint_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Gavial. What's she doing? What's with this bowing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_415_flint_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Kemar, what gives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_415_flint_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I felt a greater strength from her than anything I ever felt from Zumama.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flint"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not interested in you anymore, Gavial. Looks like you can talk to her, so please, ask her to teach me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, she wants you to teach her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess she thinks you're strong, so she wants to become your disciple or something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor, what do I do?! I've never been in a situation like this before!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It's up to you.;......;Nothing to do with me.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, how about we just let her follow us for now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. Hey, Kemar, come with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_415_flint_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flint"
    },
    {
        "text": "But call me Flint.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come to think of it, what happened to the ceremony?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, why don't you explain it to Blaze?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
