    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "She'll let her people get Oripathy just to build her machines?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't stand by and let that happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are we waiting for, Doctor? Let's go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, we still got somewhere to be!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
